<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #4CAF50, #8BC34A);
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
    <title>Rappel de votre atelier !</title>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        {#        'cid:logo' uses the logo variables we set in the emailHandler and cid is to use for email images
        It basically upload the image as attachement and then embed it in the mail  #}
        <img src="{{ 'cid:logo-txt' }}" alt="Afpa Connect Logo" width="200">
    </div>
    <div class="content" style="color: #333333;">
        <h3>Bonjour {{ reservation.firstname }},</h3>

        <p>
            Ceci est un rappel concernant votre inscription à l'atelier :
        </p>

        <h2 style="color: #4CAF50;">{{ reservation.timeslot.workshop.name }}</h2>

        <p>
            Il est prévu pour le <strong>{{ reservation.timeslot.date | format_date(locale='fr', pattern='EEEE d MMMM yyyy') }}</strong>
            à <strong>{{ reservation.timeslot.fromTime | format_time(locale='fr', pattern='HH:mm') }}</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
            Nous avons hâte de vous voir !
        </p>

        <br>
        <p style="text-align:center;">
            <a href="https://devafpaconnect.arnaudrabel.com/" class="button" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;">Visiter notre site</a>
            {# CHANGE THIS URL IN PROD
                Might need to use {{ url('app_homepage') }} for dynamic url generation
                or hardcode it to https://devafpaconnect.arnaudrabel.com/ in prod
            #}
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>Cet email est un rappel automatique. Merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
